{"id":"7eee9c2aac09b3f2","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-n-generic-set.md","title":"n-Generic Set","display":"df-n-generic-set — n-Generic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-n-generic-set","aliases":["68-df-n-generic-set"],"display":"df-n-generic-set — n-Generic Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-one-generic-set]]","[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[68-df-recursive-tree]]","[[68-df-sequence-code]]"],"source_location":"not located in supplied PDF; local genericity correction","verification_status":"local-formal-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-n-generic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-n-generic-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-n-generic-set — n-Generic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f92d2057834d0ce\" href=\"?note=2f92d2057834d0ce\" title=\"68-df-one-generic-set\">68-df-one-generic-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7e933c06a0edd826\" href=\"?note=7e933c06a0edd826\" title=\"68-df-recursive-tree\">68-df-recursive-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not located in supplied PDF; local genericity correction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-formal-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；编码像条款中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_G\">\\(\\chi_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e933c06a0edd826\" href=\"?note=7e933c06a0edd826\" title=\"68-df-recursive-tree\">68-df-recursive-tree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sc}\">\\(\\operatorname{sc}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a> 中作用于自然数编码集合的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sc}[S]:=\\{\\operatorname{sc}(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sc}[S]:=\\{\\operatorname{sc}(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{n\\text{-}Generic}(G,n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{sc}[S]\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\chi_G\\upharpoonright m\\in S)\n\\ \\lor\\ \n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\n((\\chi_G\\upharpoonright m)\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\tau\\notin S)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{n\\text{-}Generic}(G,n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{sc}[S]\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\chi_G\\upharpoonright m\\in S)\n\\ \\lor\\ \n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\n((\\chi_G\\upharpoonright m)\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\tau\\notin S)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak\\text{-}n\\text{-}Generic}(G,n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{sc}[S]\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\\exists\\tau\\in S\\;(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\chi_G\\upharpoonright m\\in S)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Weak\\text{-}n\\text{-}Generic}(G,n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{sc}[S]\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\\exists\\tau\\in S\\;(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\chi_G\\upharpoonright m\\in S)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧 Assertion 只要求击中稠密 Σ⁰_n 字符串集，实际是 weak n-generic；现将标准 n-generic 的 meet-or-avoid 与旧弱性质分开命名，避免把两者混同。n-generic 蕴涵所列 weak 性质，因为稠密集不可能在某个初段以上完全被避开；本节点不声称反向。</p>\n<p>Σ⁰_n 的复杂度作用于编码集合 sc[S]，不是未经编码的字符串对象。n=1 时与 one-generic-set 接口相符，需用 Σ⁰_1=c.e. 的已核对等价。所给短书没有泛型条目；这是本地概念补正，层级依赖的核验状态随上游保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-one-generic-set","status":"resolved","id":"2f92d2057834d0ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-one-generic-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-tree","status":"resolved","id":"7e933c06a0edd826","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-tree","status":"resolved","id":"7e933c06a0edd826","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$；编码像条款中的 $S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$。$\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$、$\\chi_G$、$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]，$\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]，$\\Sigma_n^0$ 为 [[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 中作用于自然数编码集合的第 $n$ 层。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$；编码像条款中的 $S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$。